37_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"北海道朱古力奶 102mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2240475537f02381a306e409f38340bb/2024-10/136_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"十字牌香蕉低脂奶 135mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/238559f7e86e320d5b63d91b1a1227ee/2024-10/135_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"維記高纖木瓜奶 63mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9738c17f98b6559f15cae8ac3394a1b8/2024-10/140_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"十字牌芒果木瓜奶 35mg 鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4296b29d05ae137a4bc3c42423343a33/2024-10/139_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"大阿蘇雲呢拿牛乳 未有註明鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/154c0eefb0704e26287650b3dd67a8c1/2024-10/138_1.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"Binggrae 香蕉奶 未有註明鈣質\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/09d67cdd72be7bd44100f9cb3bfa7b10/2024-10/134_1.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T23:39:12.060517+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1420,"images":38,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T02:17:59.922471+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T23:37:39.916952+00:00","content_hash":"e6c5dc2626ac35c00508dcbf53838d4bfa266f1f787232c52ec8aa31a9714d23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}